{"task_id": "HumanEval/15", "solution": "def string_sequence(n: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\" Return a string containing space-delimited numbers starting from 0 upto n inclusive.\n    >>> string_sequence(0)\n    '0'\n    >>> string_sequence(5)\n    '0 1 2 3 4 5'\n    \"\"\"\n    # Generate numbers from 0 to n (inclusive), convert each to a string.\n    # Then, join these string representations with a single space.\n    return ' '.join(map(str, range(n + 1)))"}
